      "hash": "61baea93e2e41e05",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "多、多謝幫忙啦！\\n那我們走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0760_rival_03",
      "hash": "61bae993e2e41c52",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好吧！\\n等[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好了再說吧！"
